Many of the posts on this newsgroup talk about "game balance", particularly
responses to YANI. But I think it should be remembered that not everyone
who plays Nethack is able to ascend *now*, and tipping the game balance to
make it slightly easier is not necessarily a bad thing.  

The standard answer to "too hard", "play in Explore mode until you're
better", is very unsatisfying to me.  What if there were a "difficulty
setting", like many FPS games have?

